        "ggrqIKeuOnY_text": "<p><span style=\"color:#444444;font-size:20px;\"><strong>Safe &amp; Secure</strong></span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:#444444;font-size:20px;\"> Reservation</span></p>",
        "gg4nxyNu1D0_label": "<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><strong>Reserve Discount for $3</strong></span></p>",
        "gg5AnIJk6sq_label": "<p><span style=\"color:#3A3A3A;font-size:18px;\">No Thanks</span></p>",
        "ggAFRfNo7gD_text": "<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(34,34,34);font-size:16px;\">100% Money-Back Guarantee</span></p>",
        "ggSCRXKVWd6_text": "<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:15px;\">Cancel your reservation anytime before our launch and get a full refund.</span></p>",
        "gg0q79UmC-c_text": "<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(34,34,34);font-size:16px;\">Prelaunch Refund Guarantee</span></p>",
        "ggssltrUJTQ_text": "<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:15px;\">Your reservation deposit is safe with us. If you change your mind before the launch or don’t receive the product, you can claim a full refund.</span></p>",
        "ggqGTfj6EnA_childItem_0": "<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(248,248,248);color:rgb(34,34,34);font-size:16px;\"><strong>What is the reservation deposit?</strong></span></p>",
        "ggqGTfj6EnA_childItem_1": "<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(248,248,248);color:rgb(34,34,34);font-size:16px;\"><strong>When can I get my product?</strong></span></p>",
        "ggqGTfj6EnA_childItem_2": "<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(248,248,248);color:rgb(34,34,34);font-size:16px;\"><strong>How can I claim a refund?</strong></span></p>",
        "ggqGTfj6EnA_childItem_3": "<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(248,248,248);color:rgb(34,34,34);font-size:16px;\"><strong>How can I learn more about GLYDE?</strong></span></p>",
        "ggpRUEybCjZ_text": "<p>By leaving a small refundable deposit (typically 1–5% of the product’s price), you secure the right to purchase this product at a special pre-launch discount once it becomes available. Your reservation is fully protected by our refund guarantee until successful delivery.</p>",
        "ggvxUL-EXgz_text": "<p>During a Prelaunch, product creators offer you the lowest ever exclusive price when you reserve. This is not yet a full purchase, and it’s up to you to cancel or proceed with the purchase later. Product launch and delivery timelines are somewhat unpredictable. Where possible, creators offer estimates. And if you don’t receive the product within 2 years, you’ll get a full automatic refund.</p>",
        "ggZ4Dx-kVM7_text": "<p>Claiming a refund is easy. Just email <a href=\"mailto:timchen@smarthairclipper.com\"><u>timchen@smarthairclipper.com</u></a> from the email you used to reserve the discount. Remember to mention which product you’d like to get a refund for. We’ll process it on the same day, no questions asked!</p>",
        "ggtKj8Swe2X_text": "<p>For any questions about this product, feel free to reach out to us directly at <a href=\"mailto:timchen@smarthairclipper.com\"><u>timchen@smarthairclipper.com</u></a>. Our team will be happy to provide more details or assist with your reservation.</p>",
        "gg_wbgaaMWp_text": "<p><span style=\"color:#2D2D2D;font-size:20px;\"><strong>How Prelaunch Works</strong></span></p>"
      }
    },
